{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sf393ab16663e957e","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-b82804b3a19214feb7df","text":"（三月なのかに写真を送る）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-bbefbcfae2ccf4f025a7","text":"見て！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c4a651e74d53588a86ca","text":"うわああああ！なにこれ？可愛い！！！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4de54a947d1c682df979","text":"なんか…ウチに似てない？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-675dace09adc720e80d8","text":"わざわざおめかしさせたの？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-67521025380c37452469","text":"そんなことしてない！なんでそうなる{F#の}{M#んだ}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e3b0600b889384f310cf","text":"生まれつき可愛い{F#の}{M#んだ}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e879f2f60e9444a3d630","text":"この子はルアン・メェイが創造した生命体で、生まれつき可愛い{F#の}{M#んだ}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-dcb11616bb06b2ce504a","text":"その子、列車に連れてこれたりしない？だっこして写真撮りたい！","speaker":""}]}
